    "body": "## Problem\n\nQuestion marks and negated classes consume bytes, rejecting non-ASCII filenames and allowing stars to split UTF-8 characters.\n\n## Solution\n\nReuse the UTF-8 pattern for question marks and negated classes. Extend the existing wildcard and negated-class tests.",
